will be the edgewise subdivision. You could&nbsp;
as well take for example a triangle this way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:33.540
that's also a possibility. Or even a very strange&nbsp;
triangle: like here an edge, here and here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

