So you need also a mathematical rule for doing&nbsp;
this; and the actual need for that rule is more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:46.680
apparent if you go to higher dimensions,&nbsp;
if you subdivide simplices for example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:51.900
a tetrahedra, and even higher dimensional objects.
- (So as I look at this it all seems pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:55.500
obvious but you're creating) (all this rigor&nbsp;
